Modifications in this repository (2026):
  - Standalone Gradle (AGP 8.7) build replacing the Android/AOSP build, with
    compileOnly API stubs (stubs/) and bundled SettingsLib/LineagePreference
    compatibility shims (settingslib-compat/) replacing the statically linked
    AOSP/Lineage libraries. Hidden framework APIs are called through a
    reflection bridge (io.chaldeaprjkt.gamespace.utils.HiddenApi) with
    public-API fallbacks.
  - New OLED burn-in guard features (io.chaldeaprjkt.gamespace.burnin):
    Galaxy-style black overlay lock, Xiaomi-style root backlight off, idle
    auto-entry, CPU/GPU clock and refresh-rate capping.
  - Magisk/KernelSU module packaging (magisk-module/).
  - Signed with the public AOSP test key (app/platform.jks, as shipped
    upstream) — versionCode 999999.

